  "description": "One snowy evening out on the terrace, Luan hears Yul singing and is immediately captivated by his voice. Luan is surprised to see his own honest reaction, while Yul is surprised by the simple fact that he was heard by another human being. To what lengths will Luan go to claim Yul for himself...? An enchanting new story by \"\"Jazz for Two\"\" creator Clarju.\n\n(Source: Lezhin)",
